helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3153632				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:TP_NUMPARA:NF_NEW_START\"\>Enter the number that you want to assign to the paragraph.\</ahelp\> The following paragraphs are numbered consecutively from the number that you enter here.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147581				0	cy	Line numbering				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3152771				0	cy	Specify the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06180000.xhp\" name=\"Line numbering\"\>Line numbering\</link\> options. To add line numbers to your document, choose \<emph\>Tools - Line Numbering\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345				0	cy	Include this paragraph in line numbering				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3156267				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:TRISTATEBOX:TP_NUMPARA:CB_COUNT_PARA\"\>Includes the current paragraph in the line numbering.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151026				0	cy	Restart at this paragraph				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030800.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:TRISTATEBOX:TP_NUMPARA:CB_RESTART_PARACOUNT\"\>Restarts the line numbering at the current paragraph, or at the number that you enter.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
