helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04230000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149353				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertPageFooter\"\>Adds or removes a footer from the page style that you select in the submenu. The footer is added to all of the pages that use the same page style.\</ahelp\> In a new document, only the "Default" page style is listed. Other page styles are added to the list after you apply them in the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
