helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	par_id3147225				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_FRM_ADD:CB_PROTECT_FRAME\"\>Locks the position of the selected item in the current document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05060900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153629				0	cy	Protect Size				2002-02-02 02:02:02
