helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_SORTING_PB_DELIM\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Special Characters\</emph\> dialog, where you can select the character that you want to use as a separator.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
