helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3150017				0	cy	\<variable id=\"eintraege\"\>Specify the format of the entries in the table of contents. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148774				0	cy	Level				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147569				0	cy	Structure and formatting				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638	7			0	cy	The \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line displays the table of contents code for the selected heading level. To change the appearance of a heading level you can enter codes or text in the empty boxes on this line. You can also click in an empty box or on a code, and then click a code button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292	35			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Displays the remainder of the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512	8			0	cy	To delete a code from the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click the code, and then press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Delete\</item\> key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149806	9			0	cy	To replace a code from the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click the code, and then click a code button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154480	10			0	cy	To add a code to the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click in an empty box, and then click a code button. The following codes are available:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153675				0	cy	Chapter number (E#)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154567	12			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_ENTRYNO\"\>Inserts the complete chapter heading, including, if available, the chapter number. To assign chapter numbering to a heading style, choose\<emph\> Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149691				0	cy	Entry text (E)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3154199				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_ENTRY\"\>Inserts the text of the chapter heading.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143276				0	cy	Tab stop (T)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3149490	16			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_TAB\"\>Inserts a tab stop. To add leader dots to the tab stop, select a character in the \<emph\>Fill character box\</emph\>. To change the position of the tab stop, enter a value in the \<emph\>Tab stop position \</emph\>box, or select the \<emph\>Align right \</emph\>check box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151257				0	cy	Page number (#)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3148981				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_PAGENO\"\>Inserts the page number of the entry.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147212				0	cy	 Hyperlink (LS and LE)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120221.xhp	0	help	par_id3153631	20			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:PUSHBUTTON:TP_TOX_ENTRY:PB_HYPERLINK\"\>Creates a hyperlink for the part of the entry that you enclose by the opening (LS) and the closing (LE) hyperlink tags. On the \<emph\>Structure \</emph\>line, click in the empty box in front of the part that you want to create a hyperlink for, and then click this button. Click in the empty box after the part that you want to hyperlink, and then click this button again.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
