helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mm_cusgrelin.xhp	0	help	par_idN10540				0	cy	Specify the salutation layout for \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge04.xhp\"\>mail merge\</link\> or \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mm_emabod.xhp\"\>e-mail merge\</link\> documents. The name of this dialog is different for female recipients and male recipients.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
