helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3150566				0	cy	The list contains the paragraph styles that you can assign to index levels.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3147176	5			0	cy	To create an index entry from a paragraph style, click the style in the\<emph\> Styles\</emph\> list, and then click the \<emph\>>> \</emph\>button to move the style to the index level that you want.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3149289				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_DLG_ADD_IDX_STYLES_PB_LEFT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves the selected paragraph style up one level in the index hierarchy.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120219.xhp	0	help	par_id3157903				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_IMAGEBUTTON_DLG_ADD_IDX_STYLES_PB_RIGHT\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves the selected paragraph style down one level in the index hierarchy.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
