helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150572				0	cy	If your document contains more than one script, the \<emph\>Edit Script\</emph\> dialog contains previous and next buttons to jump from script to script.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
