helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3145771				0	cy	Enter the characters that you want to combine. You can combine a maximum of 6 characters. This option is only available for the \<emph\>Combine characters\</emph\> field type.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
