helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149871				0	cy	Options				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3148569				0	cy	Specifies the number of columns and the column layout for the section.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151390				0	cy	Sections follow the text flow behavior of the page they are inserted into.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3083448				0	cy	For example, if you insert a section that uses a two-column layout into a page style that uses a four-column layout, the two-column layout is nested inside one of the four columns.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3155625				0	cy	You can also nest sections, that is, you can insert a section into another section.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
