helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3147170				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies where footnotes and endnotes are displayed as well as their numbering formats.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149800				0	cy	This tab is not available in \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03130000.xhp\" name=\"Print Layout\"\>Print Layout\</link\> view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
