helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156384	2			0	cy	\<variable id=\"datenbankaustext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ChangeDatabaseField\"\>Change the data sources for the current document.\</ahelp\> To correctly display the contents of inserted fields, the replacement database must contain identical field names. \</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153818				0	cy	For example, if you inserting address fields in a form letter from an address database, you can then exchange the database with another address database to insert different addresses.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
