helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3150996				0	cy	Defines a variable and its value. You can change the value of a variable by clicking in front of the variable field, and then choosing \<emph\>Edit - Field\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
