helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06210000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149499				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UpdateAllLinks\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Updates the links in the current document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
