helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154574	6			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:COMBOBOX:DLG_CAPTION:BOX_CATEGORY\"\>Select the caption category, or type a name to create a new category. The category text appears before the caption number in the caption label. Each predefined caption category is formatted with a paragraph style of the same name. \</ahelp\> For example, the "Illustration" caption category is formatted with the "Illustration" paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153675				0	cy	Numbering				2002-02-02 02:02:02
