helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04210000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149806	5			0	cy	The horizontal lines that are displayed here belong to the \<emph\>Rulers \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/gallery.xhp\" name=\"Gallery\"\>Gallery\</link\> theme. If you want to add more lines to the selection, open the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
