helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149180				0	cy	Shortcut Keys for Tables in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer				2002-02-02 02:02:02
