helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156048				0	cy	If the active cell is empty: selects the whole table. Otherwise: selects the contents of the active cell. Pressing again selects the entire table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	cy	If the active cell is empty: goes to the beginning of the table. Otherwise: first press goes to beginning of the active cell, second press goes to beginning of the current table, third press goes to beginning of document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154334				0	cy	If the active cell is empty: goes to the end of the table. Otherwise: first press goes to the end of the active cell, second press goes to the end of the current table, third press goes to the end of the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154931				0	cy	Increases/decreases the size of the column/row on the right/bottom cell edge				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150772				0	cy	Increase/decrease the size of the column/row on the left/top cell edge				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155593				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>removing; cell protection in text documents\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147474				0	cy	Removes cell protection from all selected tables. If no table is selected, then cell protection is removed from all of the tables in the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149504	272			0	cy	If nothing is selected, the contents of the next cell are deleted. If cells are selected, the whole line of the selection will be deleted. If all rows are selected completely or partially, the entire table is deleted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
