helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PreviewZoom\"\>Defines the number of pages displayed on screen. Click the arrow next to the icon to open a grid to select the number of pages to be displayed as rows and columns in the preview.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
