helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149805				0	cy	Page Preview: Multiple Pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154573	5			0	cy	After clicking the \<emph\>Page Preview: Multiple Pages\</emph\> icon, the\<emph\> Multiple pages\</emph\> dialog opens. Use the two spin boxes in the dialog to set the number of pages to be displayed. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
