helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\04090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147407				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertRows\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts a row in the table, below the cursor position.\</ahelp\> You can insert more than one row by opening the corresponding dialog (choose \<emph\>Format - Row - Insert\</emph\>), or by selecting more than one row before clicking the icon. The second method inserts rows of the same height as the originally selected rows.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
