helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147174				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18030200.xhp\" name=\"Time\"\>Time\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152896				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTimeField\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Inserts the current time as a field.\</ahelp\> The time is taken directly from the system settings of your operating system. A fixed time format is applied, which cannot be updated by using the F9 function key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	cy	To assign a different time format, or adapt the actual time data, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired changes in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. Additionally, you can modify the format of an inserted time field at any time by choosing \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02140000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Fields\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
