helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151392				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertTitleField\"\>Inserts the title specified in the document properties as a field.\</ahelp\> This field displays the data entered in the \<emph\>Title\</emph\> field under \<emph\>File - Properties - Description\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\18030600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148768				0	cy	If you would like to insert a different document property as a field, select \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and make the desired settings in the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"Fields\"\>\<emph\>Fields\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. The \<emph\>DocInformation\</emph\> category contains all of the fields shown in the document properties.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
