helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_preview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155055				0	cy	Use the zoom icons on the \<emph\>Page Preview\</emph\> bar to reduce or enlarge the view of the page.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_preview.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067F				0	cy	To print your document scaled down, print the zoomed preview. Click \<emph\>Print options page view\</emph\> icon to set the print options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
