helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155507				0	cy	Place the cursor immediately in front of the index entry in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155526	16			0	cy	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Index Entry\</emph\>, and do one of the following: 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
