helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149694				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>multi-page view of document\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page previews\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>overviews; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; multiple pages per sheet\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>reduced printing ; multiple pages\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
