helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145819				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>endnotes;inserting and editing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting;footnotes/endnotes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>deleting;footnotes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>removing;footnotes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>editing;footnotes/endnotes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>organizing footnotes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>footnotes; inserting and editing\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145819				0	cy	\<variable id=\"footnote_usage\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/footnote_usage.xhp\" name=\"Inserting and Editing Footnotes or Endnotes\"\>Inserting and Editing Footnotes or Endnotes\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	cy	Footnotes reference more information about a topic at the bottom of a page and endnotes reference information at the end of the document. $[officename] automatically numbers the footnotes and endnotes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155881				0	cy	To insert a footnote or endnote:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3155903				0	cy	Click in your document where you want to place the anchor of the note.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147120				0	cy	Choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04030000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Footnote\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150937				0	cy	In the \<emph\>Numbering \</emph\>area, select the format that you want to use. If you select \<emph\>Character\</emph\>, click the browse button (\<emph\>...\</emph\>) and select the character that you want to use for the footnote.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	cy	In the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>area, select \<emph\>Footnote \</emph\>or \<emph\>Endnote\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150704				0	cy	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150729				0	cy	Type the note.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3148843				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3148857\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertfootnote.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148857\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3153176				0	cy	You can also insert footnotes by clicking the \<emph\>Insert Footnote Directly\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155543				0	cy	Editing Footnotes or Endnotes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3150167				0	cy	The mouse pointer changes to a hand when you rest it over a footnote or endnote anchor in your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3155563				0	cy	To edit the text of a footnote or endnote, click in the note, or click the anchor for the note in the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145062				0	cy	To jump from the footnote or endnote text to the note anchor in the text, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>PageUp\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3145081				0	cy	To edit the numbering properties of a footnote or endnote anchor, click in front of the anchor, and choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Footnote\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147776				0	cy	To change the formatting that $[officename] applies to footnotes and endnotes, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Footnotes\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Footnotes\</emph\>\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147813				0	cy	To edit the properties of the text area for footnotes or endnotes, choose \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05040600.xhp\" name=\"Footnote\"\>\<emph\>Footnote\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_usage.xhp	0	help	par_id3147232				0	cy	To remove a footnote, delete the footnote anchor in the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
