helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108D1				0	cy	In the \<emph\>Style \</emph\>box, select a page style that uses the page background.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN108E2				0	cy	If you want to change the page background later on in the document, repeat steps 1 to 3.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
