helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153397				0	cy	Do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3156255				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02170000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Sections\"\>Format - Sections\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3153902				0	cy	Double-click in front of the variable that you used to define the condition for hiding the text, and enter a different value for the variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114				0	cy	Double-click in front of the hidden text field or the hidden paragraph field, and change the condition statement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
