helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN10700				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id6953622\" src=\"res/helpimg/dircursright.png\" width=\"3.97mm\" height=\"8.2mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6953622\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> Align right				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071D				0	cy	Type your text. %PRODUCTNAME automatically inserts the required number of blank lines, and, if the options are enabled, tabs and spaces.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Creating Alphabetical Indexes				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155911				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>concordance files;indexes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>indexes; alphabetical indexes\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>alphabetical indexes\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155911				0	cy	\<variable id=\"indices_index\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/indices_index.xhp\" name=\"Creating Alphabetical Indexes\"\>Creating Alphabetical Indexes\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	par_id3154233				0	cy	Click in your document where you want to insert the index.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	par_id3154252				0	cy	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Indexes and Tables\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	par_id3155884				0	cy	On the \<emph\>Index/Table\</emph\> tab, select "Alphabetical Index" in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114				0	cy	If you want to use a concordance file, select \<emph\>Concordance file\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Options \</emph\>area, click the \<emph\>File\</emph\>, and then locate an existing file or create a new concordance file.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	par_id3150223	28			0	cy	Set the formatting options for the index, either on the current tab, or on any of the other tabs of this dialog. For example, if you want to use single letter headings in your index, click the \<emph\>Entries\</emph\> tab, and then select \<emph\>Alphabetical delimiter\</emph\>. To change the formatting of levels in the index, click the \<emph\>Styles\</emph\> tab. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	par_id3150946				0	cy	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	par_id3150502				0	cy	To update the index, right-click in the index, and then choose \<emph\>Update Index/Table\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_index.xhp	0	help	par_id3152760				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120250.xhp\" name=\"Creating a concordance file\"\>Creating a concordance file\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Printing a Brochure				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	bm_id6743064				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>printing; individual brochures\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>booklets; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>brochures; printing individual\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F6				0	cy	\<variable id=\"print_brochure\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/print_brochure.xhp\"\>Printing a Brochure\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10614				0	cy	You can print a Writer document as a brochure or a booklet. That is, Writer prints two pages on each side of the paper, so that when you fold the paper, you can read the document as a book.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DE				0	cy	When you create a document that you want to print as a brochure, use portrait orientation for the pages. Writer applies the brochure layout when you print the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	cy	To Print a Brochure				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10621				0	cy	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B6				0	cy	In the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, click \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070E				0	cy	In the properties dialog for your printer, set the paper orientation to landscape.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10628				0	cy	Return to \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, and click \<emph\>Options\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1062C				0	cy	In the \<emph\>Pages\</emph\> area of the \<emph\>Printer Options\</emph\> dialog, select \<emph\>Brochure\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10740				0	cy	For a printer that automatically prints on both sides of a page, specify to print right pages and left pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10630				0	cy	In the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EA				0	cy	If %PRODUCTNAME prints the pages in the wrong order, open the \<emph\>Printer Options\</emph\> dialog, select \<emph\>Reversed\</emph\>, and then print the document again.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
