helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145620				0	cy	In the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> list, select the word pair that you want to remove.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3145645				0	cy	Click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
