helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	bm_id5111545				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>inserting;date fields\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>dates;inserting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>date fields;fixed/variable\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fixed dates\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>variable dates\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155165				0	cy	\<variable id=\"fields_date\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/fields_date.xhp\" name=\"Inserting a Fixed or Variable Date Field\"\>Inserting a Fixed or Variable Date Field\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	cy	You can insert the current date as a field that updates each time you open the document, or as a field that does not update.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3147679				0	cy	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Document\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	cy	Click 'Date' in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list and do one of the following:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	cy	To insert the date as a field that updates each time you open the document, click 'Date' in the \<emph\>Select \</emph\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154241				0	cy	To insert the date as a field that does not update, click 'Date (fixed)' in the \<emph\>Select \</emph\>list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Querying User Data in Fields or Conditions				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153398				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>fields; user data\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>user data; querying\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>conditions; user data fields\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hiding; with conditions\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text; hiding with conditions\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>user variables in conditions/fields\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
