helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3154239				0	cy	You can access and compare some user data from conditions or fields. For example, you can compare user data with the following operators:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3155889				0	cy	Operator				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3147110				0	cy	Meaning				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	cy	== or EQ				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3150531				0	cy	equals				2002-02-02 02:02:02
