helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155870				0	cy	To create a numbered list from non-consecutive paragraphs:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3153417				0	cy	Hold down Ctrl and drag a selection in the first numbered paragraph. You only have to select one character.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644				0	cy	Continue to hold down Ctrl, and drag a selection in each numbered paragraph of the lists you want to combine.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3145102				0	cy	On the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> Bar, click the \<emph\>Numbering On/Off \</emph\>icon twice.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Adding Input Fields				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155916				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>text; input fields\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fields; input fields in text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>input fields in text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserting;input fields\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;input fields\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155916	1			0	cy	\<variable id=\"fields_enter\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/fields_enter.xhp\" name=\"Adding Input Fields\"\>Adding Input Fields\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409				0	cy	An input field is a variable that you can click in a document to open a dialog where you can edit the variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3145776				0	cy	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other \</emph\>and click the \<emph\>Functions\</emph\> tab.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	cy	Click \<emph\>Input field \</emph\>in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3154257				0	cy	Click \<emph\>Insert \</emph\>and type the text for the variable.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155888				0	cy	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150708				0	cy	To quickly open all input fields in a document for editing, press Ctrl+Shift+F9.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Deleting Tables or the Contents of a Table				2002-02-02 02:02:02
