helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\removing_line_breaks.xhp	0	help	par_id3155858				0	cy	Use the AutoFormat feature to remove line breaks that occur within sentences. Unwanted line breaks can occur when you copy text from another source and paste it into a text document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
