helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154823				0	cy	Color table				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	cy	This table is used as a means of replacing the chart colors for the selected data rows. For example, if you selected data row 6 and then click on the color green 8, the old color of the data row is replaced by green 8. The name of the selected color is shown below the color table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
