helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155388				0	cy	Authentication Method				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_SSO_LB_MECHANISM\"\>Choose your security mechanism for access to the LDAP server.\</ahelp\> Choices are Simple or Kerberos.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
