helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148943				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_SSO_ED_USERNAME\"\>Using "simple" authentication method, you enter your user name on the LDAP server here.\</ahelp\> Using "Kerberos", you just see your user name, but cannot edit it.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01014000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153061				0	cy	Password				2002-02-02 02:02:02
