helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146792				0	cy	Direct formatting is not influenced by the \<emph\>Alignment\</emph\> field. If you center align the cell contents directly, they remain centered irrespective of whether text or numbers are involved.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
