helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\macrosecurity_sl.xhp	0	help	par_idN10567				0	cy	Select the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/macrosecurity.xhp\"\>macro security\</link\> level from one of four options. The options differ according to the security level. Macros that are allowed to run on a higher security level are also allowed to run in all lower levels.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
