helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345	2			0	cy	\<variable id=\"allgemein\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ToolsOptions\"\>Defines various settings for spreadsheets, contents to be displayed, and the cursor direction after a cell entry. You can also define sorting lists, determine the number of decimal places and the settings for recording and highlighting changes. \</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
