helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154140	39			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_HANDLES\"\>Specifies whether to display the handles (the eight points on a selection box) as simple squares without 3D effect.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
