helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156113				0	cy	Adding a New File to the Gallery				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153032				0	cy	To add a file to the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\>, right-click a theme, choose \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Files \</emph\>tab, and then click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>. You can also click an object in the current document, hold, and then drag it to the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
