helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070A				0	cy	Sets the PDF export options for images inside your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071B				0	cy	EPS images with embedded previews are exported only as previews. EPS images without embedded previews are exported as empty placeholders.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
