helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN10734				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Selects a JPEG compression of images. With a high quality level, almost all pixels are preserved.\</ahelp\> With a low quality level, some pixels get lost and artefacts are introduced, but file sizes are reduced.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
