helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10599				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Translates words with two or more characters that are in the list of common terms. After the list is scanned, the remaining text is translated character by character.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
