helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149511				0	cy	This section contains information on browsing and editing database tables.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149150				0	cy	You cannot use the data source browser on a database table that is open in Design view.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
