helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3158410				0	cy	Allows you to edit, add, or delete records from the database table.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152463				0	cy	Cutting, copying and pasting data				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287				0	cy	You can cut, copy, and paste table fields in \<emph\>Data Source\</emph\> view. The Data Source browser also supports the dragging and dropping of table fields, or simple text and numbers from other $[officename] files.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3146921				0	cy	You cannot drag and drop to Yes/No, binary, image, or counting table fields.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149064				0	cy	Drag and drop only works in \<emph\>Edit\</emph\> mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147295				0	cy	Navigating in the Data Source Browser				2002-02-02 02:02:02
