helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154398				0	cy	Use replacement table				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151234				0	cy	If you type a letter combination that matches a shortcut in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"replacement table\"\>replacement table\</link\>, the combination is replaced with the text that you specified in the \<emph\>AutoFormat\</emph\> dialog when you press F3.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150144				0	cy	Correct TWo INitial CApitals				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	cy	If you type two uppercase letters at the beginning of a "WOrd", the second uppercase letter is automatically replaced with a lowercase letter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156426				0	cy	Capitalize first letter of every sentence.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155339				0	cy	Capitalizes the first letter of every sentence.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145072				0	cy	Automatic *bold* and _underline_				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577				0	cy	Automatically applies bold formatting to text enclosed by asterisks (*), and underling to text enclosed by underscores ( _ ), for example, *bold*. The asterisks and underscores are not displayed after the formatting is applied.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	cy	This feature does not work if the formatting characters * or _ are entered with an \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#IME\" name=\"Input Method Editor\"\>Input Method Editor\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150275				0	cy	URL Recognition				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	cy	Automatically creates a hyperlink when you type a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152472				0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Delete spaces and tabs at beginning and end of paragraph \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156024				0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Removes spaces and tabs at the beginning of a paragraph. To use this option, the \<emph\>Apply Styles\</emph\> option must also be selected. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147303				0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Delete blanks and tabs at end and start of lines \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150866				0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Removes spaces and tabs at the beginning of each line. To use this option, the \<emph\>Apply Styles\</emph\> option must also be selected. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150400				0	cy	Ignore double spaces				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	cy	Replaces two or more consecutive spaces with a single space.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145116				0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Apply numbering \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870				0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Automatically creates a numbered list when you press Enter at the end of a line that starts with a number followed by a period, a space, and text. If a line starts with a hyphen (-), a plus sign (+), or an asterisk (*), followed by a space, and text, a bulleted list is created when you press Enter. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146874				0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>To cancel automatic numbering when you press Enter at the end of a line that starts with a numbering symbol, press Enter again. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145606				0	cy	The automatic numbering options is only applied to paragraphs that are formatted with the "Default", "Text body", or "Text body indent" paragraph style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157962				0	cy	Apply border				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144445				0	cy	Automatically applies a border at the base of the preceding paragraph when you type three or more specific characters, and then press Enter. To create a single line, type three or more hyphens (-), or underscores ( _ ), and then press Enter. To create a double line, type three or more equal signs (=), asterisks (*), tildes (~), or hash marks (#), and then press Enter.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10C2E				0	cy	To delete the created line, click the paragraph above the line, choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Borders\</emph\>, delete the bottom border.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
