helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\purchase.xhp	0	help	par_idN10574				0	cy	This wizard is visible for the evaluation version of %PRODUCTNAME. If you are using a time-limited evaluation version of %PRODUCTNAME, you can purchase a license online. You will get a serial number to change your %PRODUCTNAME to a full version.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
