helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN10570				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"34265\"\>Adds your index page and files to a compressed archive file and uploads the file to your web site. The index page is saved to the location that you specified. All other files are saved to the "myWebsite" directory in the directory that contains the index page.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard07.xhp	0	help	par_idN10573				0	cy	Depending on your operating system, the available archive file formats are zip, gzip, and war.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
