helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	cy	You can search for a specific topic by typing a word into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box. The window contains an alphabetical list of index terms.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669				0	cy	If the cursor is in the index list when you type the search term, the display will jump directly to the next match. When you type a word in the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box, the focus will jump to the best match in the index list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3147653				0	cy	The index and full-text searches always apply to the currently selected \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> application. Select the appropriate application using the list box on the help viewer's toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	cy	\<variable id=\"00000110\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000110.xhp\" name=\"The %PRODUCTNAME Help Window\"\>The \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Help Window\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156183				0	cy	The Help system describes commercial software from Sun Microsystems, Inc. Due to license restrictions, some of the functions described here may not be included in this particular \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> distribution.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
