helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10922				0	cy	Help Page				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10926				0	cy	You can copy from the Help Viewer to the clipboard on your operating system with standard copy commands. For example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN1092C				0	cy	On a Help page, select the text that you want to copy.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10933				0	cy	To search the current Help page:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10939				0	cy	Click the \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> icon.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10940				0	cy	The \<emph\>Find on this Page\</emph\> dialog opens.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A22				0	cy	In the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box, enter the text that you want to find.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A48				0	cy	Select the search options that you want to use.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
