helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147620				0	cy	You can incorporate a field into the current document by dragging and dropping it into the document while holding down the mouse button. A corresponding field is then set up in the document with a link to the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
