helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MoveUp\"\>Positions the selected paragraph before the one above it.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283	5			0	cy	If you have numbered paragraphs and click the\<emph\> Move Up \</emph\>icon, the numbers will be adjusted to the current order. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The \<emph\>Move Up \</emph\>icon is only visible when the cursor is positioned in a bulleted or numbered list.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>The \<emph\>Move Up \</emph\>icon appears on the \<emph\>Text Formatting\</emph\> Bar when you use the outline view.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	cy	This function can be called by pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Up Arrow.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\06100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3149827\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_moveup.png\" width=\"0.2228inch\" height=\"0.2228inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149827\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
