helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148983	2			0	cy	Click the\<emph\> Navigator On/Off \</emph\>icon to hide or show the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152594				0	cy	You can also call the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> by selecting \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\> \<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Navigator\"\>Edit - Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\> \<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Navigator\"\>Edit - Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\> \<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Navigator\"\>Edit - Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\> \<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Navigator\"\>Edit - Navigator\</link\>\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Edit - Navigator\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
