helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVX_DLG_SHOWGRIDCOLUMNS:1\"\>In the \<emph\>Show Columns\</emph\> dialog you can select the columns to be shown. Hold down the Shift or Ctrl key to select multiple entries.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
