helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153349				0	cy	Keyboard-only control of Table Controls				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153062				0	cy	To enter the special keyboard-only edit mode for Table Controls:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	cy	The form document must be in \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170500.xhp\" name=\"design mode\"\>design mode\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657				0	cy	Press Shift+F5 to select the first control. If the Table Control is not the first control, press Tab until it is selected.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3151056				0	cy	Press Enter to enter the edit mode. The handles are shown farther out from the control border.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	cy	In the edit mode, you can open the edit mode context menu by pressing Shift+F10.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	cy	Press the Escape key to exit the edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
