helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149205				0	cy	The pre-set limit value will be saved for each document. If you want to open a document in an older version of StarOffice, in which the limit of 1930 could not be changed, then you must also select the limit value 1930 in your current version of $[officename].				2002-02-02 02:02:02
