helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201				0	cy	There are wizards for inserting a list box or combo box, a table element and group boxes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection				2002-02-02 02:02:02
