helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	cy	Specifies a table from the available database tables that contains the data field whose content should be displayed as a list entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3153114				0	cy	For list boxes, a table that can be linked with the current form table is indicated. The link table must have at least one field in common with the table of the current form. This makes it possible to establish an unambiguous reference.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	cy	For combo boxes, there must be a relationship between the form table and the table containing the data to be displayed in the combo box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
