helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149987	2			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SortDown\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sorts the data of the selected field in descending order.\</ahelp\> Text fields are sorted alphabetically (Z-A), number fields in numerically descending order (9-0).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
