helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145601				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NumericField\"\>Creates a numerical field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the numerical values in the form can be adopted from the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153612				0	cy	Currency Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145324				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3152866\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_currencyfield.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152866\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145115				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CurrencyField\"\>Creates a currency field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the currency field contents for in the form can be adopted from the database.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148825				0	cy	Pattern Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149742				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3148924\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertpatternfield.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148924\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150122				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PatternField\"\>Creates a pattern field.\</ahelp\> Pattern fields consist of an edit mask and a literal mask. The edit mask determines which data can be entered. The literal mask determines the contents of the pattern field when loading the form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152947				0	cy	Please note that pattern fields are not exported into HTML format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145147				0	cy	Group Box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159334				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3153790\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_groupbox.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153790\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154572				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GroupBox\"\>Creates a frame to visually group several controls.\</ahelp\> Group boxes allow you to group option buttons in a frame.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148394				0	cy	If you insert a group frame into the document, the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01120000.xhp\" name=\"Group Element Wizard\"\>Group Element Wizard\</link\> starts, which allows you to easily create an option group.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150567				0	cy	\<emph\>Note:\</emph\> When you drag a group box over already existing controls and then want to select a control, you have to first open the context menu of the group box and choose \<emph\>Arrange - Send to Back\</emph\>. Then select the control while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145615				0	cy	Group boxes are used only for a visual effect. A functional grouping of option fields can be made through the name definition: under the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Name\"\>\<emph\>Name\</emph\>\</link\> properties of all option fields, enter the same name in order to group them.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157996				0	cy	Table Control				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156402				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3146324\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_grid.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146324\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154579				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a table control to display a database table.\</ahelp\> If you create a new table control, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170800.xhp\" name=\"Table Element Wizard\"\>Table Element Wizard\</link\> appears.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154697				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170004.xhp\" name=\"Special Information about Table Controls\"\>Special information about Table Controls\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B1E				0	cy	Navigation bar				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B2C				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id5074922\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_navigationbar.png\" width=\"0.2228inch\" height=\"0.2228inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5074922\"\>navigation bar control\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B3D				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NAVIGATIONBAR\"\>Creates a navigation bar.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11DB1				0	cy	The navigation bar allows you to move through the records of a database or a database form. The controls on this navigation bar work the same way as the controls on the default \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\"\>navigation bar\</link\> in $[officename].				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146815				0	cy	Automatic Control Focus				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150261				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3149351\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_autocontrolfocus.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149351\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3109848	137			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoControlFocus\"\>If\<emph\> Automatic Control Focus \</emph\>is activated, the first form control will be selected when you open the document. If the button is not activated, the text will be selected after opening. The \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>Tab Order\</link\> that you have specified determines which is the first form control.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07060000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Reload				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07060000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153089				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>reloading; documents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>documents; reloading\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>loading; reloading\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/07060000.xhp\" name=\"Reload\"\>Reload\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151315				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Reload\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Replaces the current document with the last saved version.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159201				0	cy	Any changes made after the last save will be lost.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	General				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152551				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>submitting forms\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>get method for form transmissions\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>post method for form transmissions\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151100				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170201.xhp\" name=\"General\"\>General\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153539				0	cy	A form is a text document or spreadsheet with different form controls. If you create a form for a Web page, the user can enter data into it to send over the Internet. The data from the form controls of a form is transmitted to a server by specifying a URL and can be processed on the server.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149283				0	cy	Name				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	cy	Specifies a name for the form. This name is used to identify the form in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"Form Navigator\"\>Form Navigator\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152425				0	cy	URL				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226				0	cy	Specifies the URL to which the data of the completed form is to be transmitted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154751				0	cy	Frame				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	cy	Defines the target frame in which the loaded URL is to appear.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152551				0	cy	Type of submission				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SUBMIT_METHOD\"\>Specifies the method to transfer the completed form information.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145065				0	cy	Using the "Get" method, the data of every control is transmitted as an environment variable. They are appended to the URL in the form "?Control1=Content1&Control2=Content2&..."; the character string is analyzed by a program on the recipient's server.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	cy	Using the "Post" method, a document is created from the content of the form that is sent to the specified URL.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147275				0	cy	Submission encoding				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159147				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SUBMIT_ENCODING\"\>Specifies the type for encoding the data transfer.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	cy	Data transfer of control information				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	cy	When sending a form, all controls available in $[officename] are taken into consideration. The name of the control and the corresponding value, if available, are transmitted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252				0	cy	Which values are transmitted in each case depends on the respective control. For text fields, the visible entries are transmitted; for list boxes, the selected entries are transmitted; for check boxes and option fields, the associated reference values are transmitted if these fields were activated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150984				0	cy	How this information is transmitted depends on the selected transfer method (Get or Post) and the coding (URL or Multipart). If the Get method and URL encoding are selected, for example, value pairs in the form <Name>=<Value> are sent.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	cy	In addition to the controls that are recognized in HTML, $[officename] offers other controls. It should be noted that, for fields with a specific numerical format, the visible values are not transmitted but rather fixed default formats. The following table shows how the data of the $[officename]-specific controls is transmitted:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153698				0	cy	Control				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562				0	cy	Value Pair				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823				0	cy	Numeric field, currency field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149734				0	cy	A decimal separator is always displayed as a period.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563				0	cy	Date field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3146794				0	cy	The date format is sent in a fixed format (MM-DD-YYYY), regardless of the user's local settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	cy	Time field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153779				0	cy	The time format is sent in a fixed format (HH:MM:SS), regardless of the user's local settings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361				0	cy	Pattern field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	cy	The values of pattern fields are sent as text fields, that is, the value visible in the form is sent.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	cy	Table control				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	cy	From the table control, the individual columns are always transmitted. The name of the control, the name of the column, and the value of the column are sent. Using the Get method with URL encoding, the transmission is done in the form <Name of the table control>.<Name of the column>=<Value>, for example, with the value being dependent on the column.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Decrease Indent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154228				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/02130000.xhp\" name=\"Decrease Indent\"\>Decrease Indent\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DecrementIndent\"\>Click the\<emph\> Decrease Indent \</emph\>icon to reduce the left indent of the current paragraph or cell content and set it to the previous tab position.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154186				0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>If you previously increased the indentation for several collectively selected paragraphs, this command can decrease the indentation for all of the selected paragraphs. \</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>The cell content defers to the current value under \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05340300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Cell - Alignment\"\>\<emph\>Format - Cell - Alignment\</emph\>\</link\>.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3150506\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_decrementindent.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150506\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155942				0	cy	Decrease Indent				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153031				0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>If you click the\<emph\> Decrease Indent\</emph\> icon while holding down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command key\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl key\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, the indent for the selected paragraph is moved by the default tab stop that has been set under \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options - Writer - General\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - General\</emph\>\</link\> .\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02170000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Background color/Paragraph background 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
