helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154840	1			0	cy	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\> \<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/02/10040000.xhp\" name=\"To  Document End\"\>To  Document End\</link\>\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>\<link href=\"text/shared/02/10040000.xhp\" name=\"Last Page\"\>Last Page\</link\>\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\10040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:LastPage\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Moves to the last page of the document.\</ahelp\> This function is only active when you select the \<emph\>Page Preview\</emph\> function on the \<emph\>File\</emph\> menu.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
