helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148983				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>comparison operators; default filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>operators; default filters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>default filters; comparison operators\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>filters; comparison operators\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148983				0	cy	Comparison Operators				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364				0	cy	The following comparative operators can be set under \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Default Filter\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313	3			0	cy	\<emph\>Comparative operator\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089	4			0	cy	\<emph\>Effect\</emph\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	cy	Equal (=)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	cy	Shows values equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	cy	Less than (<)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153761				0	cy	Shows values less than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146807				0	cy	Greater than (>)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852				0	cy	Shows values greater than the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	cy	Less than or equal to (< =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154381				0	cy	Shows values that are less than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823				0	cy	Greater than or equal to (> =)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	cy	Shows values that are greater than or equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811				0	cy	Not equal (< >)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	cy	Shows the values not equal to the condition.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	cy	Largest				2002-02-02 02:02:02
