helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	cy	On the ruler, set the tabs for the current paragraph, or all selected paragraphs, using the mouse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\13010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	cy	Initially the default tabs are shown on the horizontal ruler. Once you set a tab, only the default tabs to the right of the tab that you have set are available.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Tab Order				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146959				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170300.xhp\" name=\"Tab Order\"\>Tab Order\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150347	2			0	cy	\<variable id=\"text\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TabDialog\"\>In the\<emph\> Tab Order \</emph\>dialog you can modify the order in which control fields get the focus when the user presses the tab key.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850				0	cy	If form elements are inserted into a document, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically determines in which order to move from one control to the next when using the Tab key. Every new control added is automatically placed at the end of this series. In the \<emph\>Tab Order\</emph\> dialog, you can adapt the order of this series to your individual needs.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	cy	You can also define the index of a control through its specific properties by entering the desired value under \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Order\"\>\<emph\>Order\</emph\>\</link\> in the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog of the control.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	cy	A radio button can only be accessed by the Tab key when the radio button is selected. If you have designed a group of radio buttons where none are selected, then the user will not be able to access the group or any of the radio buttons by keyboard.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	cy	Controls				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789	5			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABORDER_CONTROLS\"\>Lists all controls in the form. These controls can be selected with the tab key in the given order from top to bottom.\</ahelp\> Select a control from the \<emph\>Controls \</emph\>list to assign the desired position in the tab order.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153750				0	cy	Move Up				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751	7			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_UP\"\>Click the\<emph\> Move Up\</emph\> button to shift the selected control one position higher in the tab order.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155339				0	cy	Move Down				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823	9			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_MOVE_DOWN\"\>Click the\<emph\> Move Down\</emph\> button to shift the selected control one position lower in the tab order.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154288				0	cy	Automatic Sort				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748	11			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_AUTO_ORDER\"\>Click the\<emph\> Automatic Sort\</emph\> button to automatically sort the controls according to their position in the document.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
