helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155081				0	cy	For the character mask "__.__.2000", for example, define the "NNLNNLLLLL" edit mask so that the user can only enter four digits when entering a date.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154818				0	cy	Strict format				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148750				0	cy	You can have a format check with control fields that accept formatted contents (date, time, and so on). \<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_STRICTFORMAT\"\>If the strict format function is activated (Yes), only the allowed characters are accepted.\</ahelp\> For example, in a date field, only numbers or date delimiters are accepted; all alphabet entries typed with your keyboard are ignored.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
