helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id50050				0	cy	In the \<emph\>Default selection\</emph\> dialog, select the entries that you want to mark as selected when you open the form that contains the list box.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
