helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154681	145			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DEFAULT_BUTTON\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The\<emph\> Default button\</emph\> property specifies that the corresponding button will be operated when you press the Return key.\</ahelp\>The\<emph\> Default button\</emph\> property specifies that the corresponding button will be operated when you press the Return key. If you open the dialog or form and do not carry out any further action, the button with this property is the default button.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
