helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\stars.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	cy	Some shapes have a special handle which you can drag to change the properties of the shape. The mouse pointer changes to a hand symbol over these special handles.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Combo Box Wizard: Database Field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144740				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170904.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box Wizard: Database Field\"\>Combo Box Wizard: Database Field\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	cy	With the combination fields, you can either save the value of a field in a database or display this value in a form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3155150				0	cy	The user values entered in the combination field or selected in the list can be saved in the database table that is accessed in the form. Note that the saving of values in another table is not possible. If the values are not to be saved in a database, they will be saved only in the form. This is especially helpful in HTML forms, where the user's entered or selected values are to be assigned to a server.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149760				0	cy	Do you want to save the value in a database field?				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3150178				0	cy	Two options are available for this question:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153394				0	cy	Yes, I want to save it in the following database field				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3147043				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_YES\"\>Specifies whether the user's entered or selected combination field value should be saved in a database field.\</ahelp\> Several database table fields are offered which can be accessed in the current form.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170904.xhp	0	help	par_id3145212				0	cy	In \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control - Properties\"\>Control - Properties\</link\> the selected field appears as an entry in the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page under \<emph\>Data field\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
