helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150255				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GrafMode\"\>Lists view attributes for the selected graphic object. The embedded or linked graphic object in the current file will not be changed, only the view of the object.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
