helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147574				0	cy	Grayscale				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	cy	The graphic object is shown in grayscale. A color graphic object can become monochrome in grayscale. You can also achieve tinted grayscale colors by raising one of the color parameters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151246				0	cy	Black and White				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	cy	The graphic object is shown in black and white. All brightness values below 50% will appear black, all over 50% will appear white.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146795				0	cy	Watermark				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	cy	The graphic object is raised in brightness and reduced in contrast so that it can be used in the background as a watermark. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
