helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3149767				0	cy	If you selected one of the date formats (DMY), (MDY), or (YMD) and you enter numbers without date delimiters, the numbers are interpreted as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
