helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000210.xhp	0	help	par_id3158405	7			0	cy	If you select the \<emph\>Fit page to print range \</emph\>option, the \<emph\>Warning Print Options\</emph\> dialog will not appear in subsequent print runs of this document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
