helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10778				0	cy	Click \<emph\>New\</emph\> to create a new menu assignment. The new menu entry appears in the \<emph\>Menu entries\</emph\> list box. Click the menu entry and enter text to rename the entry.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10783				0	cy	To assign a script to a key combination				2002-02-02 02:02:02
