helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148914	17			0	cy	Neither the start-up logo nor the initial program window will be visible. However, the $[officename] software can be controlled and documents and dialogs opened via the \<link href=\"http://api.openoffice.org\" name=\"API\"\>API\</link\>. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
