helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069C				0	cy	On the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> toolbar, click the \<emph\>Fontwork Gallery\</emph\> icon. \<image id=\"img_id7040009\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_fontworkgalleryfloater.png\" width=\"4.32mm\" height=\"4.32mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7040009\"\>Fontwork icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A0				0	cy	In the \<emph\>Fontwork Gallery\</emph\> dialog, select a Fontwork style and click OK.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN10755				0	cy	The Fontwork object is inserted into your document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A4				0	cy	Double-click the object to enter text edit mode.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D5				0	cy	Replace the default Fontwork text with your own text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
