helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B8				0	cy	The \<link href=\"text/shared/fontwork_toolbar.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\>\</link\> toolbar is displayed. If you do not see the \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> toolbar, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Fontwork\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BC				0	cy	Click an icon in the \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> toolbar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
