helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02ado.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057C				0	cy	To connect with a name to a catalog on a Microsoft SQL server that has a name turner, enter:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02ado.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057F				0	cy	PROVIDER=sqloledb;DATA SOURCE=turner;INITIAL CATALOG=First				2002-02-02 02:02:02
