helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085	20			0	cy	The\<emph\> Fields\</emph\> area displays a list of fields in the current table. You can also select multiple fields. In order to remove a field from the selection, select the empty entry at the start of the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
