helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247	2			0	cy	In the data source explorer, you can copy a table by dragging and dropping the table onto the table container. The\<emph\> Type formatting \</emph\>dialog is the third window of the \<emph\>Copy table\</emph\> dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152801				0	cy	List box				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_MULTILISTBOX_TAB_WIZ_TYPE_SELECT_LB_NEW_COLUMN_NAMES\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Lists the data fields that will be included in to the copied table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
