helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153666				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TAB_ENT_SCALE\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Enter the number of decimal places for the data field. This option is only available for numerical or decimal data fields.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
