helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A9				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Use escape sequences for outer joins. The syntax for this escape sequence is {oj outer-join}\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
