helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	cy	select Article.* from {oj item LEFT OUTER JOIN orders ON item.no=orders.ANR}				2002-02-02 02:02:02
