helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105CF				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Replaces named parameters in a data source with a question mark (?).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D2				0	cy	Display version columns (when available)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105D6				0	cy	Some databases assign version numbers to fields to track changes to records. The version number of a field is incremented by one each time the contents of the field are changed. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_DSADMIN_SUPPRESS_VERSIONCL\"\>Displays the internal version number of the record in the database table.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
