helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166466				0	cy	Fit Text to Frame				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150538				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TextFitToSizeTool\"\>Draws a text box where you click or drag in the current document. The text that you enter is automatically resized to fit the dimensions of the text box.\</ahelp\> Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145826				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3153038\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_textfittosizetool.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153038\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150860				0	cy	Fit Text to Frame				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145596				0	cy	Callouts				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153006				0	cy	Draws a line that ends in a rectangular callout from where you drag in the current document. The text direction is horizontal. Drag a handle of the callout to resize the callout. To change a rectangular callout to a rounded callout, drag the largest corner handle when the pointer changes to a hand. To add text, click the edge of the callout, and then type or paste your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150019				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3153738\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_drawcaption.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153738\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157860				0	cy	Callouts				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148390				0	cy	Fit Vertical Text to Frame				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148770				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:VerticalTextFitToSizeTool\"\>Draws a text frame with vertical text direction where you click or drag in the current document. The text that you enter is automatically resized to fit the dimensions of the frame.\</ahelp\> Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text. You can also move the cursor to where you want to add the text, drag a text frame, and then type or paste your text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147537				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3154869\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_verticaltextfittosizetool.png\" width=\"0.1335inch\" height=\"0.1335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154869\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
