helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145593				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Cube\"\>Draws a filled cube where you drag in the slide. To draw a 3D rectangle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
