helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145303				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Sphere\"\>Draws a filled sphere where you drag in the slide. To draw a spheroid, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
