helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\13030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AnimationMode\"\>Plays a preview of an animation effect that is assigned to an object, when you click the object in the slide. To select an object for editing, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Options \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key when you click.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
