helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\html_import.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146121				0	cy	\<variable id=\"html_import\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/html_import.xhp\" name=\"Importing HTML Pages Into Presentations \"\>Importing HTML Pages Into Presentations \</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\html_import.xhp	0	help	par_id3150750				0	cy	You can import any text file, including text in HTML documents, into a slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
