helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153035				0	cy	Advance to the next slide without playing object animation effects				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154558				0	cy	Return to previous slide				2002-02-02 02:02:02
