helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150439				0	cy	\<variable id=\"orgchart\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/orgchart.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Flowchart\"\>Creating a Flowchart\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	cy	To create a flowchart:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	cy	Select a tool from the \<emph\>Flowchart\</emph\> toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	cy	Drag a shape in your slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486				0	cy	To add more shapes, repeat the last steps.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146967	43			0	cy	Open the \<emph\>Connectors \</emph\>toolbar on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, and select a connector line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3149945				0	cy	Move the pointer over the edge of a shape so that the connection sites appear.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3146871				0	cy	Click a connection site, drag to a connection site on another shape, and then release.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3145824				0	cy	To add more connectors, repeat the last steps.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	par_id3153036				0	cy	You now have the basic outline for your flowchart.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\orgchart.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155255				0	cy	To add text to the shapes on your flowchart				2002-02-02 02:02:02
