helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145253				0	cy	\<variable id=\"rehearse_timings\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/rehearse_timings.xhp\" name=\"Rehearse Timings of Slide Changes\"\>Rehearse Timings of Slide Changes\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3155446	1			0	cy	$[officename] assists you in defining the right rehearse timings for automatic slide changes. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963				0	cy	Prepare the slides, start the show using a special icon, tell your imaginary audience what you want to tell for the first slide, then advance to the next slide and so on. $[officename] records the display time for each slide, so the next time you play the show with automatic slide changes, the timing will be as recorded.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146317				0	cy	To record a show with rehearse timings:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3149874				0	cy	Open a presentation, and switch to \<emph\>Slide Sorter\</emph\> View.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3145590				0	cy	When it's time to advance to the next slide, click the timer. Continue for all slides in your presentation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3150333				0	cy	$[officename] has recorded the display time for each slide. You may edit the timings in the Slide View bar. Save your presentation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3145248				0	cy	If you want the whole presentation to auto-repeat, open the menu \<emph\>Slide Show - Slide Show Settings\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>Auto\</emph\> and \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\rehearse_timings.xhp	0	help	par_id3150935				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Slide Show Settings\"\>Slide Show Settings\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
