helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154022				0	cy	\<variable id=\"table_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/table_insert.xhp\" name=\"Including Spreadsheets in Slides\"\>Including Spreadsheets in Slides\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151075				0	cy	Inserting a new $[officename] Calc spreadsheet				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	cy	You can add a blank $[officename] Calc spreadsheet to a slide as an OLE object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	cy	Go to the slide where you want to insert the spreadsheet.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3146313	18			0	cy	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Spreadsheet\</emph\>. Click in the spreadsheet to enter your data. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3148870				0	cy	To resize the spreadsheet without resizing the cells, double-click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle. To resize the cells of the spreadsheet, click the spreadsheet, and then drag a corner handle.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150215				0	cy	Inserting $[officename] Calc spreadsheets from a file				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154765				0	cy	When you insert an existing spreadsheet into your slide, changes that are made to the original spreadsheet file are not updated on your slide. You can, however, make changes to the spreadsheet in your slide.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
