helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017				0	cy	Every slide in a presentation has exactly one slide master, also known as master page. A slide master determines the text formatting style for the title and outline and the background design for all slides that use this slide master.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149018				0	cy	To apply a new slide master				2002-02-02 02:02:02
