helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154486				0	cy	Default printer settings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156385				0	cy	To set the default printing options for $[officename] Impress, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153914				0	cy	Setting printer options for the current presentation				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651				0	cy	Choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3149870				0	cy	Click \<emph\>Options\</emph\>, and then select the printer options.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3150431				0	cy	These settings override the default printer options in \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - Print\</emph\> for the current print job only.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
