helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148492				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06130000.xhp\" name=\"AutoInput\"\>AutoInput\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoComplete\"\>Switches the AutoInput function on and off, which automatically completes entries, based on other entries in the same column.\</ahelp\> The column is scanned up to a maximum of 2000 cells or 200 different strings.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	cy	The completion text is highlighted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065D				0	cy	To accept the completion, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\> or a cursor key.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10665				0	cy	To append text or to edit the completion, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F2\</item\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066D				0	cy	To view more completions, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Tab\</item\> to scroll forward, or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift+Tab\</item\> to scroll backward.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	cy	When typing formulas using characters that match previous entries, a Help tip will appear listing the last ten functions used from \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\>, from all defined range names, from all database range names, and from the content of all label ranges.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	cy	AutoInput is case-sensitive. If, for example, you have written "Total" in a cell, you cannot enter "total" in another cell of the same column without first deactivating AutoInput.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Array Functions				2002-02-02 02:02:02
