helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN10D6B				0	cy	B (formula)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B75				0	cy	B (result)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
