helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166091				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TREND\"\>Returns values along a linear trend.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
