helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3166346				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_VARIATION\"\>Calculates the points of an exponential trend in an array.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
