helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148491				0	cy	Optimal Row Heights				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	cy	\<variable id=\"optitext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SetOptimalRowHeight\"\>Determines the optimal row height for the selected rows.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The optimal row height depends on the font size of the largest character in the row. You can use various \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000003.xhp#metrik\" name=\"units of measure\"\>units of measure\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
