helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCPAGE_SUBT_OPTIONS:BTN_SORT\"\>Sorts the area that you selected in the \<emph\>Group by\</emph\> box of the Group tabs according to the columns that you selected.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
