helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10590				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387654\"\>Select the layout mode for the field in the list box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10593				0	cy	Empty line after each item				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059A				0	cy	Show automatically				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059E				0	cy	Displays the top or bottom nn items when you sort by a specified field.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
