helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\format_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id1650440				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05990000.xhp\"\>Define Text Attributes\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\format_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id363475				0	cy	Sets the layout and anchoring properties for text in the selected drawing or text object.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
