helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150465				0	cy	Rate: the annual rate of interest.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3146940				0	cy	Price: the price of the security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
