helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153933				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>ODDLPRICE function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153933				0	cy	ODDLPRICE				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145145				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_ODDLPRICE\"\>Calculates the price per 100 currency units par value of a security, if the last interest date falls irregularly.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152784				0	cy	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3155262				0	cy	ODDLPRICE(Settlement;Maturity;Last interest;Rate;Yield;Redemption;Frequency;Basis)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149689				0	cy	Settlement: the date of purchase of the security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148753				0	cy	Maturity: the date on which the security matures (expires).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150861				0	cy	Last interest: the last interest date of the security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3155831				0	cy	Rate: the annual rate of interest.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153328				0	cy	Yield: the annual yield of the security.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149186				0	cy	Redemption: the redemption value per 100 currency units of par value.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149726				0	cy	Frequency: number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153111				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999				0	cy	Settlement date: February 7 1999, maturity date: June 15 1999, last interest: October 15 1998. Interest rate: 3.75 per cent, yield: 4.05 per cent, redemption value: 100 currency units, frequency of payments: half-yearly = 2, basis: = 0				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148567				0	cy	The price per 100 currency units per value of a security, which has an irregular last interest date, is calculated as follows:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150332				0	cy	ODDLPRICE("2/7/1999";"6/15/1999";"10/15/1998"; 0.0375; 0.0405;100;2;0) returns 99.87829.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153564				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>ODDLYIELD function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153564				0	cy	ODDLYIELD				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3158002				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_ODDLYIELD\"\>Calculates the yield of a security if the last interest date falls irregularly.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
