helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3159125	72			0	cy	=IMARGUMENT("3+4j") returns 0.927295.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149146				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>IMCOS function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
