helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152980				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3157901	79			0	cy	=IMCOS("3+4j") returns -27.03-3.85i (rounded).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150024				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>IMDIV function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
