helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3150741	84			0	cy	Numerator, Denominator: the complex numbers are entered in the form "x + yi" or "x + yj"				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151229				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3148440	86			0	cy	=IMDIV("-238+240i";"10+24i") returns 5+12i.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153039				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>IMEXP function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
