helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159094				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>ROT13 function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159094				0	cy	ROT13				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3146781				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_ROT13\"\>Encrypts a character string by moving the characters 13 positions in the alphabet.\</ahelp\> After the letter Z, the alphabet begins again (Rotation). By applying the encryption function again to the resulting code, you can decrypt the text.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150893				0	cy	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
