helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3149316				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_DAYSINMONTH\"\>Calculates the number of days in a month until a given date.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
