helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3147501				0	cy	Date: The date up through which the days in the month is calculated. The Date parameter must be a valid date according to the locale settings of %PRODUCTNAME.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149871				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3155742				0	cy	DAYSINMONTH(A1) returns 29 days if A1 contains 2/17/68, a valid date for February 1968.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
