helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145173				0	cy	All cells are recalculated after a sheet cell has been modified. Any charts in the sheet will also be refreshed. If the\<emph\> AutoCalculate\</emph\> function is activated, the \<emph\>Recalculate\</emph\> function F9 is not available.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
