helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3148974				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SEKUNDE\"\>Returns the second for the given time value.\</ahelp\> The second is given as an integer between 0 and 59.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
