helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3153350				0	cy	SECOND(NOW()) returns the current second				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_second.xhp	0	help	par_id3150831				0	cy	SECOND(C4) returns 17 if contents of C4 = 12:20:17.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
