helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3157790				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_PI\"\>Returns the value of PI (rounded value 3.14159).\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
