helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3145876				0	cy	If you enter the number 17.546 in the \<emph\>number\</emph\> field, with 1 specified as the number of rounding places, 17.5 will be returned as the result.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
