helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164484				0	cy	The square root of 16 is 4.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3164560				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>SQRTPI function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
