helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164596				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_SQRTPI\"\>Returns the square root of a number*PI.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
