helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164627				0	cy	SQRTPI (Number)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164641				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164654				0	cy	=SQRTPI(2) returns the rounded value 2.506628.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3164669				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>random numbers; calculating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>RANDBETWEEN function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164669				0	cy	RANDBETWEEN				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164711				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_RANDBETWEEN\"\>Returns an integer random number between \<emph\>Bottom\</emph\> and \<emph\>Top\</emph\> (both inclusive).\</ahelp\> To recalculate press Shift+Ctrl+F9.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
