helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164785				0	cy	=RANDBETWEEN (20;30) returns an integer of between 20 and 30.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3164800				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>RAND function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
