helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_today.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145659				0	cy	\<variable id=\"today\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/func_today.xhp\"\>TODAY\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_today.xhp	0	help	par_id3153759				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_HEUTE\"\>Returns the current computer system date.\</ahelp\> The value is updated when you reopen the document or modify the values of the document.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
