helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_datevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3145087				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DATWERT\"\>Returns the internal date number for text in quotes.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_datevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3149281				0	cy	The internal date number is returned as a number. The number is determined by the date system that is used by $[officename] to calculate dates.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
