helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_datevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3154819	23			0	cy	\<emph\>Text\</emph\> is a valid date expression and must be entered with quotation marks.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_datevalue.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156309				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_datevalue.xhp	0	help	par_id3155841	25			0	cy	DATEVALUE("7/20/54") yields 19925				2002-02-02 02:02:02
