helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152589				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>FIND function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152589				0	cy	FIND				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3146149				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FINDEN\"\>Looks for a string of text within another string.\</ahelp\> You can also define where to begin the search. The search term can be a number or any string of characters. The search is case-sensitive.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
