helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150608	48			0	cy	\<emph\>find_text\</emph\> refers to the text to be found.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152374	49			0	cy	\<emph\>text\</emph\> is the text where the search takes place.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152475	50			0	cy	\<emph\>position\</emph\> (optional) is the position in the text from which the search starts.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
