helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156375	52			0	cy	FIND(76;998877665544) returns 6.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149268				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>FIXED function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149268				0	cy	FIXED				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3155833				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FEST\"\>Specifies that a number be displayed with a fixed number of decimal places and with or without a thousands separator. This function can be used to apply a uniform format to a column of numbers.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152470				0	cy	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147567				0	cy	FIXED(Number; decimals; no thousands separators)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151272	38			0	cy	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> refers to the number to be formatted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156322	39			0	cy	\<emph\>Decimals\</emph\> refers to the number of decimal places to be displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150877	40			0	cy	\<emph\>No thousands separators\</emph\> (optional) determines whether the thousands separator is used. If the parameter is a number not equal to 0, the thousands separator is suppressed. If the parameter is equal to 0 or if it is missing altogether, the thousands separators of your \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01140000.xhp\" name=\"current locale setting\"\>current locale setting\</link\> are displayed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149040				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145208	42			0	cy	FIXED(1234567.89;3) returns 1,234,567.890. FIXED(1234567.89;3;1) returns 1234567.890.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147083				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>LEFT function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
