helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153152	100			0	cy	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> (optional) specifies the number of characters for the start text. If this parameter is not defined, one character is returned.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
