helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156008	110			0	cy	LEN("Good Afternoon") returns \<emph\>14\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154300	111			0	cy	LEN(12345.67) returns \<emph\>8\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
