helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150494				0	cy	REPT(text; number)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154859	197			0	cy	\<emph\>text\</emph\> is the text to be repeated.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150638	198			0	cy	\<emph\>number\</emph\> is the number of repetitions.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149922				0	cy	The result can be a maximum of 255 characters.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156213				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148626	200			0	cy	REPT("Good morning"; 2) returns \<emph\>Good morningGood morning\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
