helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154111	127			0	cy	\<emph\>text\</emph\> is the text where the search will take place.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149559	128			0	cy	\<emph\>position\</emph\> (optional) is the position in the text where the search is to start.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
