helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154830				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>SUBSTITUTE function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154830				0	cy	SUBSTITUTE				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153698				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_WECHSELN\"\>Substitutes new text for old text in a string.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150994				0	cy	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147582				0	cy	SUBSTITUTE(text; search_text; new text; occurrence)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153675	178			0	cy	\<emph\>text\</emph\> is the text in which text segments are to be exchanged.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155	179			0	cy	\<emph\>search_text \</emph\>is the text segment that is to be replaced (a number of times).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145779	180			0	cy	\<emph\>new text\</emph\> is the text that is to replace the text segment.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150348	181			0	cy	\<emph\>occurrence\</emph\> (optional) indicates how many occurrences of the search text are to be replaced. If this parameter is missing the search text is replaced throughout.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150946				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150412	183			0	cy	SUBSTITUTE("123123123"; "3"; "abc") returns \<emph\>12abc12abc12abc\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154915	238			0	cy	SUBSTITUTE("123123123"; "3"; "abc"; 2) returns \<emph\>12312abc123\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148977				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>T function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
