helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147377				0	cy	TEXT(Number; Format)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147389	162			0	cy	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the numerical value to be converted.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156167	163			0	cy	\<emph\>Format\</emph\> is the text which defines the format. Use decimal and thousands separators according to the language set in the cell format.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151039				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>TRIM function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
