helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148539				0	cy	UPPER(text)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3148496	66			0	cy	\<emph\>text\</emph\> refers to the lower case letters you want to convert to upper case.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
