helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149315				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3155757\" src=\"sc/res/pages.png\" width=\"6.35mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155757\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
