helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147299				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3150394\" src=\"sc/res/date.png\" width=\"6.35mm\" height=\"6.35mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150394\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
