helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150792				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PagebreakMode\"\>Display the page breaks and print ranges in the sheet. Choose \<emph\>View - Normal\</emph\> to switch this mode off.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153877				0	cy	The context menu of the page break preview contains functions for editing page breaks, including the following options:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154731				0	cy	Delete All Manual Breaks				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DeleteAllBreaks\"\>Deletes all manual breaks in the current sheet.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155067				0	cy	Add Print Range				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764				0	cy	Adds the selected cells to print ranges.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
