helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3149030				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_GAUSS\"\>Returns the standard normal cumulative distribution.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
