helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3153976				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_RANG\"\>Returns the rank of a number in a sample.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
