helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertRowBreak\"\>Inserts a row break (horizontal page break) above the selected cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
