helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_idN109D1				0	cy	In the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> you can choose commands to create a new style, delete a user-defined style, or change the selected style.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
