helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3147249				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MINA\"\>Returns the minimum value in a list of arguments. Here you can also enter text. The value of the text is 0.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150435				0	cy	Syntax				2002-02-02 02:02:02
