helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148743				0	cy	Example				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3147401				0	cy	=MINA(1; "Text"; 20) returns 0.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3147295				0	cy	=MINA(A1:B100) returns the smallest value in the list.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
