helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159264				0	cy	For data range				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154703				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_COLROWNAMERANGES:ED_DATA\"\>Sets the data range for which the selected label range is valid. To modify it, click in the sheet and select another range with the mouse.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
