helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02190100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DeleteRowbreak\"\>Removes the manual row break above the active cell.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02190100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	cy	Position the cursor in a cell directly below the row break indicated by a horizontal line and choose \<emph\>Edit - Delete Manual Break - Row Break\</emph\>. The manual row break is removed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Value Highlighting				2002-02-02 02:02:02
