helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3152810				0	cy	Number: the hexadecimal number. The number can have a maximum of 10 places. The most significant bit is the sign bit, the following bits return the value. Negative numbers are entered as two's complement.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
