helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05020600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156283				0	cy	This cell protection only takes effect if you also protect the spreadsheet (\<emph\>Tools - Protect Document - Sheet\</emph\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
