helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN10971				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"sc:ListBox:RID_SCPAGE_TABLE:LB_SCALEMODE\"\>Select a scaling mode from the list box. Appropriate controls will be shown at the side of the list box.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155089				0	cy	Reduce/enlarge printout				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159171				0	cy	Specifies a scaling factor to scale all printed pages.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN1099A				0	cy	Scaling factor				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152899				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_METRICFIELD_RID_SCPAGE_TABLE_ED_SCALEALL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a scaling factor. Factors less than 100 reduce the pages, higher factors enlarge the pages.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B2				0	cy	Fit print range(s) to width/height				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B5				0	cy	Specifies the maximum number of pages horizontally (width) and vertically (height) on which every sheet with the current Page Style is to be printed. 				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BB				0	cy	The print ranges are always scaled proportionally, so the resulting number of pages may be less than specified.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BF				0	cy	You may clear one of the boxes, then the unspecified dimension will use as many pages as necessary.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C3				0	cy	If you clear both boxes, this will result in a scaling factor of 100%.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109CE				0	cy	Width in pages				2002-02-02 02:02:02
