helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eomonth.xhp	0	help	par_id3146787				0	cy	\<emph\>Start date\</emph\>: calculated from this point onwards.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eomonth.xhp	0	help	par_id3155615				0	cy	\<emph\>Months\</emph\>: the number of months before (negative) or after (positive) the Start Date.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
