helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\07080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	cy	You can also use the mouse to split the window horizontally or vertically. To do this, drag the thick black line located directly above the vertical scrollbar or directly to the right of the horizontal scrollbar into the window. A thick black line will show where the window is split.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
