helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\02\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSWIN_SUMME\"\>Automatically adds the numbers in the cell range that you specify. Click in a cell, click this icon, and then enter the cell range. You can also drag to define a cell range in the spreadsheet.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
