helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\specialfilter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147300				0	cy	Copy row 1 with the row headers (field names), to row 20, for example. Enter the filter conditions linked with OR in rows 21, 22, and so on.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
