helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748				0	cy	\<variable id=\"row_height\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/row_height.xhp\" name=\"Changing Row Height or Column Width\"\>Changing Row Height or Column Width\</link\>\</variable\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3154017				0	cy	You can change the height of the rows with the mouse or through the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	cy	What is described here for rows and row height applies accordingly for columns and column width.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153963				0	cy	Using the mouse to change the row height or column width				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	cy	Click the area of the headers on the separator below the current row, keep the mouse button pressed and drag up or down in order to change the row height.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3159237				0	cy	Select the optimal row height by double-clicking the separator below the row.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154659				0	cy	Using the dialog to change the row height or column width				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3150367				0	cy	Click the row so that you achieve the focus.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3166432				0	cy	Start the context menu on the header at the left-hand side.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3154487				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05340100.xhp\" name=\"Row height\"\>Row height\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
