helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152959				0	cy	Column spacing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_MATRIXCOL_DIST\"\>Determines the spacing between matrix elements in a column.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
