helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154198				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_ATTRIBUT_DIST\"\>Defines the height of the symbols in relation to the baseline.\</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
