helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147492				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_OVERLINEX\"\>Inserts a line over a placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>overline<?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. The line adjusts itself to correct length.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
