helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153916	3			0	cy	The \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> dialog is set up like the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01020000.xhp\" name=\"Open\"\>Open\</link\> dialog under \<emph\>File\</emph\>. Use the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> dialog to load, edit and display a formula saved as a file in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
