helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156320				0	cy	Default				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145206				0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:PUSHBUTTON:RID_FONTSIZEDIALOG:1\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Click this button to save your changes as a default for all new formulas.\</ahelp\> A security response appears before saving any changes.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
