helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090903.xhp	0	help	par_id3150300				0	cy	A third example of how to use \<emph\>$[officename] Math\</emph\> to create symbols with indexes is shown below. You can copy the example into the clipboard and use it in your own formula in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
