helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091506.xhp	0	help	par_id3161843				0	cy	The \<emph\>color\</emph\> command changes the character color; first enter the \<emph\>color\</emph\> command directly in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. Then enter the color name (black, white, cyan, magenta, red, blue, green, or yellow). Then enter the characters to be changed.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
