helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	cy	Some \<link href=\"text/smath/01/03090900.xhp\" name=\"examples\"\>examples\</link\> show you the range of operations. You can find more examples in the \<emph\>Samples - Formulas\</emph\> folder.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151244				0	cy	The selection window is divided into two parts. Clicking a symbol at the top of the window displays its subordinate symbols in the lower half of the window.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
