helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\newline.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147339				0	cy	How to write formulas in $[officename] Math over two lines (with manual line break):				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\newline.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	cy	Create a line break by using the "newline" command. Everything coming after the line break is placed on the next line.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
