helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	cy	\<emph\>Expression1, Expression2:\</emph\> Any string or numeric expressions that you want to compare. If the expressions match, the \<emph\>CBool\</emph\> function returns \<emph\>True\</emph\>, otherwise \<emph\>False\</emph\> is returned.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
