helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	cy	Month (Number)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154366				0	cy	Return value:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
