helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	cy	\<image id=\"img_id3152460\" src=\"res/baswatr.png\" width=\"0.25inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152460\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
