helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03130500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154096				0	cy	If this value is set to \<emph\>true\</emph\>, the \<emph\>Shell\</emph\> command and all $[officename] tasks wait until the shell process completes. If the value is set to \<emph\>false\</emph\>, the shell returns directly. The default value is \<emph\>false\</emph\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
