helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153380				0	cy	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	cy	\<emph\>LibName:\</emph\> String expression that specifies the name of the DLL.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090405.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	cy	FreeLibrary can only release DLLs that are loaded during Basic runtime.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
