helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154367				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>Seek function\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154367				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020304.xhp\" name=\"Seek Function [Runtime]\"\>Seek Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	cy	Determines the position for the next writing or reading in a file that was opened with the open statement. The return value corresponds to the value determined by the Seek statement:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194				0	cy	For random access files, the Seek function returns the number of the next record to be read.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3161831				0	cy	For all other files, the function returns the byte position at which the next operation is to occur.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	cy	See also: \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020103.xhp\" name=\"Open\"\>Open\</link\>, \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03020305.xhp\" name=\"Seek\"\>Seek\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
