helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156344				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030102.xhp\" name=\"DateValue Function [Runtime]\"\>DateValue Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150542				0	cy	Returns a number from a date string. The date string is a complete date in a single numeric value. You can also use this serial number to determine the difference between two dates.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148799				0	cy	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
