helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798	6			0	cy	\<emph\>Text\</emph\>: String expression displayed as a message in the dialog box. Line breaks can be inserted with Chr$(13).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769	7			0	cy	\<emph\>DialogTitle\</emph\>: String expression displayed in the title bar of the dialog. If omitted, the title bar displays the name of the respective application.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228	8			0	cy	\<emph\>Type\</emph\>: Any integer expression that specifies the dialog type, as well as the number and type of buttons to display, and the icon type. \<emph\>Type\</emph\> represents a combination of bit patterns, that is, a combination of elements can be defined by adding their respective values:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161832				0	cy	0 : Display OK button only.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	cy	1 : Display OK and Cancel buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	cy	2 : Display Abort, Retry, and Ignore buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147318				0	cy	3 : Display Yes, No and Cancel buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155412				0	cy	4 : Display Yes and No buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	cy	5 : Display Retry and Cancel buttons.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159155				0	cy	16 : Add the Stop icon to the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145366				0	cy	32 : Add the Question icon to the dialog.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
