helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	cy	In this example, the prefix is ContListener_. The following subroutines must therefore be implemented in Basic:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	cy	ContListener_disposing				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146923				0	cy	ContListener_elementInserted				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147318				0	cy	ContListener_elementRemoved				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152578				0	cy	ContListener_elementReplaced				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150592				0	cy	An event structure type that contains information about an event exists for every Listener type. When a Listener method is called, an instance of this event is passed to the method as a parameter. Basic Listener methods can also call these event objects, so long as the appropriate parameter is passed in the Sub declaration. For example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
