helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03010305.xhp\" name=\"RGB Function [Runtime]\"\>RGB Function [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010305.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	cy	Returns a \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000003.xhp#farbcodes\" name=\"long integer color value\"\>long integer color value\</link\> consisting of red, green, and blue components.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
