helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101140.xhp	0	help	par_idN10577				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03101140.xhp\"\>DefStr Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101140.xhp	0	help	par_idN10587				0	cy	If no type-declaration character or keyword is specified, the DefStr statement sets the default variable type, according to a letter range.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
