helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146958				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03100700.xhp\" name=\"Const Statement [Runtime]\"\>Const Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	cy	Defines a string as a constant.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
