helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155420				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>IIf statement\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155420				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03090103.xhp\" name=\"IIf Statement [Runtime]\"\>IIf Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145610				0	cy	Returns one of two possible function results, depending on the logical value of the evaluated expression.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159413				0	cy	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	cy	IIf (Expression, ExpressionTrue, ExpressionFalse)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150541				0	cy	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153381				0	cy	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Any expression that you want to evaluate. If the expression evaluates to \<emph\>True\</emph\>, the function returns the result of ExpressionTrue, otherwise it returns the result of ExpressionFalse.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870				0	cy	\<emph\>ExpressionTrue, ExpressionFalse:\</emph\> Any expression, one of which will be returned as the function result, depending on the logical evaluation.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	tit				0	cy	Mid Function, Mid Statement [Runtime]				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143268				0	cy	\<bookmark_value\>Mid function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Mid statement\</bookmark_value\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143268				0	cy	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120306.xhp\" name=\"Mid Function, Mid Statement [Runtime]\"\>Mid Function, Mid Statement [Runtime]\</link\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148473				0	cy	Returns the specified portion of a string expression (\<emph\>Mid function\</emph\>), or replaces the portion of a string expression with another string (\<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154285				0	cy	Syntax:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530				0	cy	Mid (Text As String, Start As Long [, Length As Long]) or Mid (Text As String, Start As Long , Length As Long, Text As String)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	cy	Return value:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	cy	String (only by Function)				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154347				0	cy	Parameters:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148664				0	cy	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> Any string expression that you want to modify.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359	9			0	cy	\<emph\>Start: \</emph\>Numeric expression that indicates the character position within the string where the string portion that you want to replace or to return begins. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451				0	cy	\<emph\>Length:\</emph\> Numeric expression that returns the number of characters that you want to replace or return. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	cy	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid function\</emph\> is omitted, all characters in the string expression from the start position to the end of the string are returned.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	cy	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\> is less than the length of the text that you want to replace, the text is reduced to the specified length.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3150769				0	cy	\<emph\>Text:\</emph\> The string to replace the string expression (\<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\>).				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149560				0	cy	Example:				2002-02-02 02:02:02
