helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131800.xhp	0	help	par_id3154186				0	cy	Creates a Basic Uno object that represents a Uno dialog control during Basic runtime.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131800.xhp	0	help	par_id3153750				0	cy	Dialogs are defined in the dialog libraries. To display a dialog, a "live" dialog must be created from the library.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131800.xhp	0	help	par_id3153681				0	cy	See \<link href=\"text/sbasic/guide/sample_code.xhp\" name=\"Examples\"\>Examples\</link\>.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
