helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166423				0	cy	Settings				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150365				0	cy	Define the settings for a bar chart in this area. Any changes apply to all data series of the chart, not to the selected data only.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
