helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150206				0	cy	 Secondary axis				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166428				0	cy	Use this area to assign a second axis to your chart. If a data row is already assigned to this axis, $[officename] automatically displays the axis and the label. You can turn off these settings later on. If no data has been assigned to this axis and you activate this area, the values of the primary Y axis are applied for the secondary axis.				2002-02-02 02:02:02
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152988				0	cy	X axis				2002-02-02 02:02:02
