helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154762	41			0	cy	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:DLG_AXIS:CB_Y_SECONDARY\"\>The major axis and the secondary axis can have different scaling. For example, you can scale one axis to 2 in. and the other to 1.5 in. \</ahelp\>				2002-02-02 02:02:02
